Advantages:

- Saves time during initial document preparation.
- Provides structured document drafts.
- Supports multiple document types.
- Offers a user-friendly interface.
- Provides a download option.

Future Enhancements:

- Add more legal document templates.
- Support additional languages.
- Improve document formatting.
- Add document history and management.
- Strengthen privacy and security controls.

Conclusion:

LegalEase demonstrates how artificial intelligence can assist with the initial preparation of legal documents. By combining Python, Streamlit, and Google Gemini, the application provides a simple way to generate structured legal drafts. Professional legal review is necessary before signing or using any generated document.

